    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in one of the labs of their research station, a group of scientists muster their only resistance against a hostile boarding party. Hacking into the hovering tank drone the invaders brought with them, they manage to compromise its targeting system, turning it - and its powerful railgun - against its former masters. Now the tank must clear the space station of all hostiles - level by level, shot by shot.<br><br><i>IFF</i>\u00a0is a top-down shooter where the player takes control of a hover tank, using its powerful gun and its bouncing projectiles to clear out different types of enemies. The shots are powerful and can clear out a room, but the long cooldown between shots means you need to plan your attack and take advantage of the architecture to maximize effectiveness.<br><br>One shot, one kill. Make them count, and good hunting!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in one of the labs of their research station, a group of scientists muster their only resistance against a hostile boarding party. Hacking into the hovering tank drone the invaders brought with them, they manage to compromise its targeting system, turning it - and its powerful railgun - against its former masters. Now the tank must clear the space station of all hostiles - level by level, shot by shot.<br><br><i>IFF</i>\u00a0is a top-down shooter where the player takes control of a hover tank, using its powerful gun and its bouncing projectiles to clear out different types of enemies. The shots are powerful and can clear out a room, but the long cooldown between shots means you need to plan your attack and take advantage of the architecture to maximize effectiveness.<br><br>One shot, one kill. Make them count, and good hunting!</p>",
